# PaganiStack network allowlist
#
# Opt-in. This file only affects Claude Code's WebFetch tool through the
# webfetch-guard hook. Shell commands, curl, and agent-browser egress are NOT
# covered; use an OS firewall or proxy for those.
#
# Copy this file to pagani/network-allowlist.txt to enable the guard:
#   pagani network init
#
# One host per line. Blank lines and comments (#) are ignored.
# Exact matches only, unless the line starts with "*.".
#   example.com      allows example.com
#   *.github.com     allows api.github.com but not github.com
#                    (add github.com separately if you need it)
#
# Examples:
github.com
raw.githubusercontent.com
code.claude.com
opencode.ai
localhost
127.0.0.1
*.githubusercontent.com
